  "question": {
    "text": "In the circuit shown in the figure, the switch was kept in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;for a very long time and then at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;it is shifted to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. The current in the circuit immediately after that is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-05-22_at_7.15.58_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 166px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The total flux, before and after the position change of the switch, remains the same</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
